────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  SECTIONS            │ ── Actions ───────────────────────────────────────────  
  ▸ Navigation        │ cc  mark done / undo                                    
    Filter & search   │ uc  undo done (unmark, or resume an exited session)     
    Actions           │                                                         
    Mouse             │ ── Session commands ──────────────────────────────────  
    Modes             │ :undone [sel]           undo done                       
    Legend            │ :uc :resume [sel]       undo done: unmark a running     
    Session commands  │                         session, or resume an exited    
    App commands      │                         one                             
    Attached session  │ :undo [sel] [-turns N]  restore the folder to before    
                      │                         the agent's last turn (asks     
                      │                         first) (off)                    
                      │ :redo [sel]             bring back what :undo replaced  
                      │                         (off)                           
